              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Possible new effects in superconductive tunnelling
              %strong 1
              7 (1962) Pages 251-253 [
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0031-9163(62)91369-0"}> doi10.1016/0031-9163(62)91369-0
              ]
          %p Introduction and review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                A. A. Golubov, M. Yu. Kupriyanov†, and E. Il’ichev:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The current-phase relation in Josephson junctions
                %strong 76
                (2004) 411 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.76.411"}> doi:10.1103/RevModPhys.76.411
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                Anna Posazhennikova:
                %em Josephson effect in Superconductors and Superfluids
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0908.1761"}> arXiv:0908.1761
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                Francesco Tafuri (ed.):
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fundamentals and Frontiers of the Josephson Effect
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 286
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
